type: software
title: >-
  Reference-dosimetry: a calculator for reference dosimetry of radiotherapy beams
  (60Co, MV photons, electrons) according to IAEA TRS-398 Rev.1 and AAPM TG-51
authors:
  - family-names: Melentev
    given-names: Aleksandr Valerievich
    alias: mesava
version: 0.23.0
date-released: "2026-10-19"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23430818
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.23430818
    description: Все версии (concept DOI), ведёт на последнюю / All versions (concept DOI), resolves to the latest
repository-code: "https://github.com/mesava/Reference-dosimetry"
url: "https://mesava.github.io/Reference-dosimetry/"
abstract: >-
  A Russian- and English-language web calculator for the absorbed dose to water in reference conditions
  for 60Co, MV photon and electron beams according to IAEA TRS-398 Rev.1 and AAPM TG-51 (with the 2014 photon
  addendum and WGTG51 Reports 374 and 385), with cross-calibration, Jaffé plot, electron depth-dose tools,
  an uncertainty budget with a traceable origin of every value, and a department journal with output trends,
  control charts and dosimeter checks. Every correction and message references the protocol section, equation
  or table; results are verified against independent calculations of real linac calibrations.
keywords:
  - radiotherapy
  - medical physics
  - reference dosimetry
  - absorbed dose to water
  - TRS-398
  - TG-51
  - ionization chamber
  - uncertainty budget
  - statistical process control
